              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Pick the zone and add a label</h3><p>For another time zone, choose the place the room needs to follow. Add a label such as New York, London office or Event time.</p><p>Everyone knows which time they are seeing.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-clock-world-time-on-tv.html#step-4\">Follow this step in Show a Full-Screen Clock or World Time on TV</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-clock-world-time-on-tv.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-clock-world-time-on-tv.iiif.json/note/5",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Set 12/24-hour format, seconds and date</h3><p>Choose the time format. Turn seconds or the date on when they are useful, and select readable colours.</p><p>The time detail suits the room.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-clock-world-time-on-tv.html#step-5\">Follow this step in Show a Full-Screen Clock or World Time on TV</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-clock-world-time-on-tv.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-clock-world-time-on-tv.iiif.json/note/6",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Choose Show now</h3><p>Put the clock on the display. Change its settings from the controller while the screen keeps the time visible.</p><p>The room has one clear shared clock.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-clock-world-time-on-tv.html#step-6\">Follow this step in Show a Full-Screen Clock or World Time on TV</a></p>"
